EdgeVision also references the Rockchip rknn_model_zoo v2.3.2 YOLO11 example
for the YOLO11 output layout, DFL decode, anchor-free grid, and RKNN output
handling. The referenced rknn_model_zoo source is distributed under Apache
License 2.0. The optimized YOLO11 model artifact is supplied by the upstream
example and its separate redistribution terms must be verified before product
distribution.

The referenced Rockchip source files carry their own Apache License 2.0
notices. This project does not currently select a root-project LICENSE; the
final licensing decision is deferred to the V1 release audit.
